  <p class="mx-body" style="max-width:560px;margin-top:14px">Enter a brand and a real buyer question. We send it verbatim to each engine's official API and show you exactly what comes back — cited or not, in its own words.</p>

  <div class="mx-card panel">
    <div class="row">
      <div><label class="fld" for="brand">Brand / organisation</label>
        <input type="text" id="brand" value="{{ demo.brand_default }}" autocomplete="off"></div>
      <div><label class="fld" for="query">Buyer-intent query</label>
